  "limitations": [
    "Only idle offline sources are supported; approval is a host trust decision, not inspection of captured memory",
    "No new exhaustion, adversarial, networked checkpoint, cross-platform restore or Linux ARM64 qualification",
    "Native runtime restart test uses retained in-memory store; PostgreSQL tests independently exercise encrypted schema-v3 persistence, not a fresh-BEAM runtime fault campaign",
    "Benchmark is five samples per source after warmup with warm host caches, bare guest and tiny shell command; not arbitrary Python startup or universal speedup",
    "No upstream source modified, no runtime pin or library release version changed, no publication",
    "Final source differences after native execution and analyzer checks are documentation wording only; final docs generation and link checks were repeated."
  ],
